&lt;p>Package multipart implements MIME multipart parsing, as defined in &lt;a href="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2046.html">RFC 2046&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	Package multipart 实现 MIME multipart 解析，如 RFC 2046 中所定义。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The implementation is sufficient for HTTP (&lt;a href="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2388.html">RFC 2388&lt;/a>) and the multipart bodies generated by popular browsers.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	该实现足以用于 HTTP (RFC 2388) 和流行浏览器生成的 multipart 主体。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>quotedprintable</title><link>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/quotedprintable/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 11:11:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/go_docs/stdLib/mime/quotedprintable/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>
